    "methods_description": "EEG data were collected simultaneously from 32-channel active montages (cortical responses) and passive bipolar montages (subcortical responses, FCz to earlobe). Initial sampling rate was 25 kHz, with cortical data downsampled to 1 kHz and subcortical data to 10 kHz. Experiment 1 (n=28) involved diotic presentation of two audiobooks at 65 dB SPL with selective attention cues. Experiment 2 (n=25) used dichotic stimulus presentation at 65 dB SPL. Experiment 3 (n=14) involved passive listening to paired audiobooks at 73-76 dB SPL. Trigger onset times were corrected for tubing delay of insert earphones.",
